      "alt": "Abstract visionary engraving, mathematical revelation being corrected: Claude manifested as an immense incandescent orange orb with hundreds of intricate tentacles, spreading across a midnight-indigo cosmos like a circuit-woven sun. Opposite it floats Namagiri, Ramanujan’s mathematical goddess, an ethereal many-armed presence composed of cobalt light, sacred ornament and cascading equations. She offers a luminous formula; one precise orange tendril crosses out an errant symbol and inscribes its replacement, other tendrils gently rearranging her divine mathematics. Far below both beings, a small human Srinivasa Ramanujan bends over a wooden desk, writing in an open notebook beneath an amber lamp, oblivious to the cosmic editorial exchange overhead. Equations descend toward his pages like tangled rain. Dense copperplate linework, microscopic glyphs, flowing neural filaments, Byzantine mosaic luminosity, abstract sacred geometry, flat ornamental space, immense differences of scale, molten amber and electric blue against near-black navy, sublime, mysterious, quietly absurd",
